# Build-context filter for the REPO ROOT.
#
# The repo root is used as a Docker build context by exactly one build:
# `build-inspector-runner` in .github/workflows/docker.yml
# (context: . , dockerfile: ./inspector-runner/Dockerfile), whose Dockerfile
# COPYs only inspector-runner/ and inspector/. Every other image builds from its
# own subdirectory (./backend, ./frontend, ./inspector, …) and is unaffected by
# this file.
#
# So: exclude everything, then re-include just the two directories that the
# inspector-runner image needs — keeping its build context small and fast.
*
!inspector-runner
!inspector
